Package: pawsdocs
Title: Build Tools for the Paws R Website
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Paws", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Internal build tooling that converts paws Rd documentation to
    Markdown and assembles the mkdocs site for the paws-r website. Ports the
    logic previously held in build/rd2md.R and build/build_assests.R into a
    tested, importable package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
